"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Grain exports from Russia and Ukraine are decreasing because both countries are attacking each other's shipping facilities and ports.\",            \"english_title\": \"Grain Exports Decrease\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las exportaciones de grano de Rusia y Ucrania est\u00e1n bajando porque ambos pa\u00edses est\u00e1n atacando los puertos y lugares de env\u00edo del otro.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Exportaciones de Grano Bajan\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Israeli security forces have reportedly left, and about a dozen settlers are said to remain at the site where two families have been trapped since Sunday.\",            \"english_title\": \"Settlers Remain at Site\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las fuerzas de seguridad de Israel se han ido, y se dice que unos doce colonos quedan en el lugar donde dos familias han estado atrapadas desde el domingo.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Colonos Quedan en el Lugar\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Emergency workers rescued a 32-year-old person after a 10-hour operation, pulling them from under concrete slabs.\",            \"english_title\": \"Rescue Operation Success\",            \"translated_version\": \"Trabajadores de emergencia rescataron a una persona de 32 a\u00f1os despu\u00e9s de una operaci\u00f3n de 10 horas, sac\u00e1ndola de debajo de losas de concreto.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Operaci\u00f3n de Rescate Exitosa\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An online petition accusing Pete Hoekstra of interfering in Canadian domestic affairs has gained more than 60,000 signatures.\",            \"english_title\": \"Petition Against Pete Hoekstra\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una petici\u00f3n en l\u00ednea acusando a Pete Hoekstra de interferir en asuntos de Canad\u00e1 ha conseguido m\u00e1s de 60,000 firmas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Petici\u00f3n Contra Pete Hoekstra\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A vessel reportedly overturned after being hit by strong waves, and a well-preserved motorcycle and identification tags were found with the bodies.\",            \"english_title\": \"Vessel Overturned by Waves\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un barco se volc\u00f3 despu\u00e9s de ser golpeado por olas fuertes, y una moto bien conservada y etiquetas de identificaci\u00f3n fueron encontradas con los cuerpos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Barco Volcado por Olas\"        }    ]}"